    "checkedAt": "2026-10-01",
    "notes": [
      "Only UR and SSR equipment are modeled. SR was intentionally excluded because it is not relevant for the intended team-planning use case.",
      "Enhancement curves are measured at 0-star Ascension.",
      "The SSR Staff of Wonders-equivalent weapon value at Enhancement Lv3 was corrected from 4428 to 428.",
      "UR Shield HP at Enhancement Lv91 was corrected to 1005865.",
      "Weapon, Shield, Accessory and Headgear use the same enhancement curve for the same rarity and stat type.",
      "Ascension increases the three normal equipment stats by 10% per Ascension level, based on the already-enhanced stat value.",
      "Flat main stats are rounded up after the Ascension multiplier.",
      "Ascension extra effects are separate from the 10%-per-level main-stat multiplier.",
      "Ascension levels 6-10 replace the corresponding extra effect from Ascension levels 1-5."
    ]
